[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168791749","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109434#issuecomment-3168791749","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109434","id":3168791749,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc683-zF","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:23:04Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:23:04Z","body":"> bruvzg10:14 AM\n> Removing alpha seems to give more sharp result.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168791749/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168809532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109434#issuecomment-3168809532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109434","id":3168809532,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc684DI8","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:31:09Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:31:09Z","body":"The problem is with some ad hoc changes we made to the MSDF sampling code\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a219a58ad050519a8a51b76f7f43e15accc577/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/canvas.glsl#L465-L467\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a219a58ad050519a8a51b76f7f43e15accc577/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/canvas.glsl#L512-L516\n\nThe code from the MSDFGen library is (https://github.com/Chlumsky/msdfgen):\n\n```\nfloat median(float r, float g, float b) {\n    return max(min(r, g), min(max(r, g), b));\n}\n\nvoid main() {\n    vec3 msd = texture(msdf, texCoord).rgb;\n    float sd = median(msd.r, msd.g, msd.b);\n    float screenPxDistance = screenPxRange()*(sd - 0.5);\n    float opacity = clamp(screenPxDistance + 0.5, 0.0, 1.0);\n    color = mix(bgColor, fgColor, opacity);\n}\n```\n\nNotice how we include the alpha when computing the median? We are taking the min between the channel (the single channel sdf) and the msdf value. Which means that we basically take on all the artifacts that you would get with a single channel SDF","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168809532/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168829235","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109434#issuecomment-3168829235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109434","id":3168829235,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc684H8z","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:40:07Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:40:07Z","body":"Can you check if this occurs in 4.4.1 as well? Since it's not caused by that specific commit","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168829235/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168837648","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109434#issuecomment-3168837648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109434","id":3168837648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc684KAQ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:44:01Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:44:01Z","body":"MSDF rendering was using this median calculation from the start (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/51908), so should be reproducible in all 4.x versions.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168837648/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]